<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-JLG cut, stock tumbles.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-JLG cut, stock tumbles.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities said it cut its rating of JLG Industries Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Cliff Ransom was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell nearly 30 percent, off 5-1/2 to 13-7/8 in heavy trading on the NYSE.</p>
</text>
